(5, 'Importance of Business', 'https://dengrweb.com/image/notice/H0y0GIHsPBxdJn2hQ4wEMharxKKGlRMTYaRtuOgdVqAbmvuZO16Qc2sJCyzkN35W4UF5CSYoW9NF7DBf1SXTPjmeiA7LZ9bkewo6Importance-of-Business.webp', '<p>Business plays a crucial role in the economy by providing goods and services, creating jobs, and driving innovation. It also contributes to society by supporting communities and promoting social and economic development. In today&rsquo;s globalized and highly competitive environment,&nbsp;Importance of business environment&nbsp;must adapt to changing market conditions and emerging technologies in order to stay relevant and successful. Additionally, with the rise of e-commerce, businesses have access to a global market, and many small businesses have been able to compete and grow with the help of the internet. Therefore, the<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays\">importance of business</a></strong>&nbsp;in today&rsquo;s society cannot be overstated.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#1\">Businesses widen the employment opportunities</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#2\">Aiding the local businesses</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#3\">Working for the needs and desires of society</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#4\">Aiming at higher returns</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#5\">Importance Of Business In Our Society</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#6\">Benefits Of Business?</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/business/the-importance-of-business-nowadays#7\">FAQ about Business Nowdays</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Business refers to the activity of producing, selling, and exchanging goods and services for profit. It encompasses a wide range of activities, including manufacturing, retail, wholesale, finance, and services. importance of business can be owned by individuals, partnerships, corporations, or other legal entities . The main objective of a business is to generate profit by providing goods and services that satisfy the needs and wants of customers.&nbsp;Importance of business communication&nbsp;do this by identifying and meeting customer demand, managing costs, and maximizing revenue.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Businesses widen the employment opportunities</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If the importance of business did not exist, there would not have been any employment opportunities. They are an aspect of any famous venture. It leverages the company&rsquo;s growth and boosts its economic power. Moreover, they support inventions and they create a multitude of career opportunities for strategic entrepreneurs to devise policies for a<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investment_banking\">successful investment</a>.</strong>&nbsp;These people provide exceptional services and a&nbsp;Importance of business communication&nbsp;-like mindset.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It does not always depend on monetary investments only but involves skills, the ability to crack a deal and introduce various strategies to boost importance of business growth.<br />\r\nIt is an undeniable fact that such an industry offers innumerable career opportunities, be it in the fields of marketing, technology, and trade. importance of business inspire advancement where progress transforms our ways of living. Industries work incredibly hard to reach greater heights.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There mindset encourages them to introduce, innovate, and create new inventions. The desire to do so involves vacancies in the job fields. And This is how budding entrepreneurs get this profitable opportunity to showcase their talents. Once the venture prospers, it affects people&rsquo;s standards of living while improving their quality of life. One should agree that they have been becoming increasingly important. I am sure you understand that.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Aiding the local businesses</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The reputed companies have now been collaborating and supporting the local enterprises in&nbsp;Importance of business environment&nbsp;growth and development. In Such ways, they have been able to flourish and impact on a global level. These&nbsp; generate high revenues and encourage companies profit-making. Because of these ventures, workers and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/working-professionals/tips-for-being-the-employee-of-the-month\"><strong>employees are getting to earn</strong></a>&nbsp;a living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is the efforts of millions of people that keep our economy going. Small enterprises progress when an increase in product demand. This way, they are learning and earning simultaneously. It&rsquo;s difficult to run and market it. It is everyone&rsquo;s mutual efforts that uplift a successful venture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Importance of business are only flourishing when people invest in their products and services. It&rsquo;s all related to the relationship between the consumer and the market that leads to a profitable venture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The economy gets directly connected to business-related activities, some way or the other. If the businesses collapse, so will the economy. Therefore, reputed companies are given opportunities to the smaller enterprises to kick-start their ventures and aim high.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Working for the needs and desires of society</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>They run and progress to fulfil the needs and desires of society. Are you wondering how?&nbsp;&acirc;&mdash; For example- There&rsquo;s a demand for a product named &ndash; Athletic shoes. The quantity for the shoes is being sold rapidly in the market. The need for the same soars high, enabling the companies to manufacture such products as per the market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&acirc;&mdash; The production of goods and services increases with an increase in its demand. And it even leads to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/engineering/benefits-of-manufacturing-engineering-as-a-career\">the manufacturing of new products</a>&nbsp;and commodities. Consumer&rsquo;s needs and market demand fluctuates or even goes hand in hand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&acirc;&mdash; Every company has its one best product that makes its business shine while offering skyrocketing profits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is not a simple process. The importance of it is highly valued and regarded as it has transformed people&rsquo;s lives to a great extent. The industries have reached a juncture in our lives that has been full of surprises and wonders. These enterprises are constantly trying to achieve breakthroughs by strategizing about the needs and demands of society. And that&rsquo;s how importance of business=</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&lsquo;are trying to affect us.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Aiming at higher returns</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As we all know, importance of business have been affecting our day-to-day expenditures. Be it buying the different products or availing their services, we are a part of this. Our expenses, called taxes, have been helping them by letting them catapult good revenue for their company. Isn&rsquo;t this an exciting process? Undoubtedly, they have been depending on us to enable their productivity growth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Indeed, we get affected by such business-related activities. Be it paying for the taxes like traveling and entertainment, or any other cause we are helping the companies gain high revenues. Without such a process, our economy wouldn&rsquo;t have reached anywhere. The taxes help the ventures run smoothly. It is the people that uplift the&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/online-courses/business-courses/financial-courses/finding-the-money-to-finance-our-dreams\">business&rsquo;s motives and objectives</a>.</strong>&nbsp;And that is how these industries prosper.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We conclude that&nbsp;Importance of business environment&nbsp;have been increasingly becoming important nowadays. Business firms employ people whose strategies help the industries flourish productively. It has been offering countless job vacancies in this sector, too.<br />\r\nIt is the investment in knowledge,&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.careerguide.com/career/online-courses/business-courses/financial-courses/5-tips-for-building-a-career-in-finance\">finances</a></strong>&nbsp;and mutual efforts that makes a business a success.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Importance of business in our society?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Business plays a crucial role in society by providing goods and services that people need and want.&nbsp;Importance of business communication&nbsp;also create jobs, generate revenue, and contribute to economic growth and development. Here are some specific ways that importance of business in our society:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Job Creation:</strong>&nbsp;Importance of business communication are one of the main drivers of job creation, providing employment opportunities for millions of people around the world.&nbsp;<strong>Innovation:</strong>&nbsp;Businesses drive innovation by developing new products, services, and technologies that improve our quality of life and create new opportunities for growth and development.&nbsp;<strong>Economic Growth:</strong>&nbsp;Businesses contribute to economic growth by generating revenue, investing in research and development, and creating new markets and industries.&nbsp;<strong>Taxation:</strong>&nbsp;Businesses pay taxes that support government programs and services, including education, healthcare, and infrastructure.&nbsp;<strong>Corporate Social Responsibility:</strong>&nbsp;Many businesses have social and environmental responsibilities and are committed to reducing their impact on the environment, supporting local communities, and promoting ethical&nbsp;Importance of business communication&nbsp;practices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>Benefits of business?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Businesses offer numerous benefits to individuals, society, and the economy as a whole. Here are some of the key benefits of business:&nbsp;Job Creation: Businesses create jobs, which help people earn a living and improve their standard of living. They provide employment opportunities for workers of all levels of education and experience.&nbsp;Economic Growth: Businesses contribute to economic growth by generating revenue, investing in research and development, and creating new markets and industries. This, in turn, stimulates economic activity and raises the standard of living for everyone.&nbsp;Innovation: Businesses drive innovation by developing new products, services, and technologies that improve our quality of life and create new opportunities for growth and development.<br />\r\nCompetition: Competition between businesses promotes efficiency and innovation, which can lead to better products and services at lower prices.<br />\r\nConsumer Choice: Businesses provide consumers with a wide range of choices and options, allowing them to choose the products and services that best meet their needs and preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>FAQ about Business Nowdays</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>Q1.How does business foster innovation?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Businesses are at the forefront of innovation, developing new products, services, and technologies. They invest in research and development, driving progress and addressing societal challenges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Q2.What is the impact of business on employment?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Business enterprises are major employers, providing job opportunities for individuals across various sectors and industries.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Q3.How does business contribute to economic growth?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Business activities, such as investments, production, and trade, stimulate economic growth by increasing productivity, creating new markets, and fostering competition that leads to efficiency and innovation.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Q4.How does business contribute to personal financial well-being?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Businesses create employment opportunities and income for individuals, allowing them to earn a living, support their families, accumulate wealth, and improve their standard of living.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Q5.How does business impact local communities?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Businesses provide products and services that meet the needs of local communities, stimulate economic development, support local suppliers, and contribute to tax revenues that fund public services and infrastructure.</p>\r\n', NULL, '2023-07-12 12:28:36'),
(14, 'About Sql', 'https://dengrweb.com/image/notice/wBmvfnrUytGe7HMXQ5UBPQLd6MpufdzauEgRjTK0VccN1OLW26ReDPZkhCq4moilZElF15G3Y438rFgDXSOVsbTwbxnSp9xsJKIzSql_data_base_with_logo.png', '<p>What is SQL?</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>SQL stands for Structured Query Language</li>\r\n	<li>SQL lets you access and manipulate databases</li>\r\n	<li>SQL became a standard of the American National Standards Institute (ANSI) in 1986, and of the International Organization for Standardization (ISO) in 1987</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>What Can SQL do?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>SQL can execute queries against a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can retrieve data from a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can insert records in a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can update records in a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can delete records from a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can create new databases</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can create new tables in a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can create stored procedures in a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can create views in a database</li>\r\n	<li>SQL can set permissions on tables, procedures, and views</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>SQL is a Standard - BUT....</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Although SQL is an ANSI/ISO standard, there are different versions of the SQL language.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However, to be compliant with the ANSI standard, they all support at least the major commands (such as&nbsp;<code>SELECT</code>,&nbsp;<code>UPDATE</code>,&nbsp;<code>DELETE</code>,&nbsp;<code>INSERT</code>,&nbsp;<code>WHERE</code>) in a similar manner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong>&nbsp;Most of the SQL database programs also have their own proprietary extensions in addition to the SQL standard!</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>Using SQL in Your Web Site</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>To build a web site that shows data from a database, you will need:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>An RDBMS database program (i.e. MS Access, SQL Server, MySQL)</li>\r\n	<li>To use a server-side scripting language, like PHP or ASP</li>\r\n	<li>To use SQL to get the data you want</li>\r\n	<li>To use HTML / CSS to style the page</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>RDBMS</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>RDBMS stands for Relational Database Management System.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>RDBMS is the basis for SQL, and for all modern database systems such as MS SQL Server, IBM DB2, Oracle, MySQL, and Microsoft Access.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The data in RDBMS is stored in database objects called tables. A table is a collection of related data entries and it consists of columns and rows.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Look at the &quot;Customers&quot; table:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SELECT&nbsp;*&nbsp;FROM&nbsp;Customers;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every table is broken up into smaller entities called fields. The fields in the Customers table consist of CustomerID, CustomerName, ContactName, Address, City, PostalCode and Country. A field is a column in a table that is designed to maintain specific information about every record in the table.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A record, also called a row, is each individual entry that exists in a table. For example, there are 91 records in the above Customers table. A record is a horizontal entity in a table.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A column is a vertical entity in a table that contains all information associated with a specific field in a table.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, '2023-07-16 15:04:46'),
(16, 'Best UI and UX design tools of 2023', 'https://dengrweb.com/image/notice/dwGmfRn2i1BbQ7O7t4uGg8lacxsvQNMcnSiPI8q5fhMADKHszePHFryTqrVVJ0O5IXJK6pNTLF9bC4DE2mUWgAuUody3l0jLRZkW1633281680-ux-vs-ui-cover-edited-e1634554774488.webp', '<h4>The aim of user interface (UI) design is to achieve beauty, harmony, and usability when laying out a website with elements like typography, color schemes and imagery. In user experience (UX) design, the goal is to anticipate the user&rsquo;s journey and translate it into an intuitive and welcoming website</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re a professional designer or a hands-on entrepreneur, there are many programs available today to help you do this. So in this article, we&rsquo;ll roundup the best UI and UX design tools for you <em>and</em> your <a href=\"https://www.wix.com/website/design\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">website design</a> that you should keep in your arsenal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Wix&rsquo;s visual editor removes the learning curve from UI and UX design when you <a href=\"https://www.wix.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">create your website</a>. Right from the start, users have a ready-to-go template for everything&mdash;whole websites, full pages, sections and individual components.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Below you&rsquo;ll find information on:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-dj22t\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">FlowMapp</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-4l5e2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Miro</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-3pkve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Balsamiq</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-b15iv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Figma</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-3falh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Adobe XD</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-65ado\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Sketch</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-2oss0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Proto.io</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/ux-design-tools?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=15541610090^134848741670&amp;experiment_id=^^568798457222^^_DSA&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqs6lBhCxARIsAG8YcDhYbdzN57niQvzQBqFEERB-llav7XXTsfHBtIZ45z8lypBvipr0NnYaAvm1EALw_wcB#viewer-52e6g\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Marvel</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>8 Best UI and UX design tools</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The following tools include a wide range of solutions that will help you strategize, organize, visualize and implement <a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/inclusive-design\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">inclusive designs</a> and interactions for your website. What&rsquo;s more, you don&rsquo;t need to be a professional designer or have programming skills to reap the benefits of these solutions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. FlowMapp</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/what-is-ux-design\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UX design</a> takes into consideration the entire picture of a product&rsquo;s creation&mdash;from its design to its launch. The process entails five steps: Ideation and definition, research, analysis, design, testing, and then finalization, launch and repeat. To help you with the first three steps of the process, <a href=\"https://www.flowmapp.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FlowMapp</a> offers a number of UX tools and templates that help create:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/how-to-create-a-user-persona-ux\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">User personas</a></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>User flows</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Customer journey maps</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Sitemaps</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The web-based app also provides clients sharing and collaborative capabilities for teams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Miro</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Both UX and UI designers use whiteboard tools throughout their process to brainstorm, plan, iterate and design. <a href=\"https://miro.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Miro</a> is a whiteboard tool that comes with useful pre-built UX and wireframing templates.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can also use it for UI, as you add images, files, and third-party tools to your whiteboard and have your collaborators give feedback with commenting and voting features. The app is available for browser, desktop (Mac and Windows), as well as mobile and tablet devices (iOs and Android).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. Balsamiq</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once you hit the design phase, you&rsquo;ll likely create <a href=\"https://www.wix.com/blog/what-is-a-wireframe-and-how-to-create-one\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">low-fidelity wireframes</a> to communicate your vision. <a href=\"https://balsamiq.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Balsamiq</a> is a <a href=\"https://www.wix.com/encyclopedia/definition/user-interface-ui\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UI design</a> tool that enables users to quickly create these web page sketches. In addition to laying down the structure and main components for each page, users can create wireframes based on specific devices and operating systems, using premade UI components and icons (e.g. Buttons, Forms, Media, etc.) The tool&rsquo;s drag-and-drop interface can be mastered in minutes, and can be accessed via a browser or desktop app (Mac and Windows).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. Figma</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.figma.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Figma</a> is a multipurpose web/desktop/and mobile solution that spans the entire UI and UX design process. The first three steps can be completed via its online whiteboard FigJam. From there, you can actually design and test both your lo-fi wireframes and hi-fi prototypes from the main Figma app as well hand off your designs to developers to build.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Plugins created specifically for Figma will make the process of designing a website go more smoothly and quickly, too. For instance, there are plugins for spell check, stock photo integration, and data visualization.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Adobe XD</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adobe is a powerhouse in the design field. Of all the apps in the Creative Cloud suite, <a href=\"https://www.adobe.com/products/xd.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Adobe XD</a> is your best option for UI and UX design and can be accessed via desktop or mobile. Because it&rsquo;s part of the larger Adobe family, users also benefit from built-in features they won&rsquo;t find in other UI design apps. For instance:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Object blur</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Vector drawing</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Blend mode</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Lottie animation</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Adobe fonts</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Its design editor enables users to design wireframes, mockups and prototypes all from the same tool&mdash;so there&rsquo;s no need to switch from tool-to-tool once you get started with Adobe XD. Its collaboration feature enables coediting with in-app comments and mentions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What&rsquo;s more, it comes with a built-in design system, so you can save and reuse global settings for components like colors, typography, shapes, imagery and more. This feature is great for design consistency and efficiency.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6. Sketch</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sketch.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sketch</a> is a great tool for efficient and precise UI design. Its editor is well-organized and includes easy-to-use features like Snapping and Smart Guides that help size, space and align UI elements. When it&#39;s time to hand off your designs to a developer, the app&rsquo;s version control, UI inspection and asset downloads turn this into a seamless process. Sketch is available as a Mac app, plus a web app and Mirror (mobile) apps for previewing designs and testing prototypes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7. Proto.io</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://proto.io/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Proto.io</a>&rsquo;s intuitive drag-and-drop editor gives you the ability to prototype designs created in Figma, Adobe XD, and Sketch or to create designs from scratch with the help of Proto.io&rsquo;s library of UI assets, fonts and more. Create them on the web-based app, then use their iOS and Android mobile apps for previewing and testing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because this is first and foremost a prototyping platform, Proto.io has all the tools you need to bring static designs to life: set up triggers and actions for different UI elements, create advanced animations for any page, layer, or component you want, plus add screen transitions, Lotties, GIFs, videos and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8. Marvel</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Technically, you can do all of your design work with <a href=\"https://marvelapp.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Marvel</a>&rsquo;s web-based app&ndash;wireframe, design UIs, prototype, and test&mdash;but you can also sync it with another design platform like Sketch. Validation is an important part of UX design, but it&rsquo;s a process that designers often have to manage outside of their design tools. With Marvel&rsquo;s user testing tool, you can run user tests on your prototypes right where they are.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, '2023-07-16 15:19:30'),
(20, 'Why Every Business Needs A Website', 'https://dengrweb.com/image/notice/XY0sCnFalHx08wxndeopUlsaTZNSevd3DWWcwuGm7hUoIr6VEQP2krRfyR148qJ6bvy3M59Q4ZjMBGXLJ5EIfVT9tjktDLBgzqbi960x0.webp', '<p>A business&rsquo;s online presence, regardless of industry, can have a massive impact on its success. In this day and age, some businesses still don&rsquo;t realize that a majority of their customers will visit their website before making a purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nHaving a strong online presence, particularly a website, can be make or break for generating more revenue. Yes, the quality of your website impacts results, but the purpose of this article to stress the importance of making sure you have a website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I&rsquo;ve helped numerous companies of varying sizes create their digital presences. In some cases, organizations are hesitant to get online because they feel they are not tech-savvy enough and don&rsquo;t understand how to manage a website. Other times, companies are concerned about the price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe good news is that there&rsquo;s a solution out there that will work for you. If you still need convincing, here are the top reasons it&rsquo;s important for your business to have a website:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Credibility</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the main reasons you should have a website for your business is to increase your organization&rsquo;s credibility. Chances are there are several providers offering a similar service to yours. One way you can stand out is by having a website that looks good and clearly communicates quality information to your consumers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nWithout a website, people may question your legitimacy as a business. Having a website is an opportunity to make a great first impression and give people comfort that you&rsquo;re a real business.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Brand</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Showcasing your brand to your prospective customers is one of the most important things that you can do. By clearly establishing who you are, what you represent and what you stand for, you increase the chances of your customers buying from you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is also something that can set you apart from your competitors. Without a website, it can be incredibly challenging to do this because people can&rsquo;t easily find quality and reliable information on your business.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Leads</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Perhaps one of the most intriguing reasons to have a website for your business is because it can increase your chances of getting leads.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nOnce people find you online, become interested in your product or service and want to know more, they&rsquo;ll know how to contact you thanks to the information on your website, which gives you the opportunity to increase your sales. Even though websites have a cost, when used correctly, they have a positive ROI.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Organic Traffic&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once you&rsquo;re online and have an SEO-optimized website, you have a chance of showing up in Google search results. This means that when people are searching for a product or service, there is a chance your website will show up in the results. This gives you the opportunity to drastically increase your customer base.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saving You Time + Customer Service</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many businesses get calls from prospects or existing customers asking simple questions about location and hours of operation. If you miss a call, the customer is left unhappy. Calls can also distract your staff from focusing on the most important parts of your business. A website can reduce these calls and increase internal productivity. At the same time, it helps customers find useful information without needing to call, which ultimately provides an all-around better user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nUpdates And Announcements</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since your website is on 24/7, it&rsquo;s easy to post updates and announcements to your customers. It&rsquo;s a way to keep them up to date on everything that you&rsquo;re doing. When something is particularly relevant to them, it increases the chance of you being able to upsell them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Digital Marketing</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you plan on leveraging digital marketing to increase your leads and grow your business, you&rsquo;ll likely want to drive traffic to a website or landing page. To do this effectively, leverage historic traffic that has been going to your website so you can target the most qualified customers and get the best ROI on your ad spend. This is something that can&rsquo;t be set up retroactively, so it is best to get your website running early even if you&rsquo;re not planning on running ads at the moment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Websites have become essential to business today. I strongly recommend creating one if you haven&rsquo;t done so already. You can improve it over time, but the key is to start.</p>\r\n', NULL, '2023-07-17 01:28:01');
